// Programmatic migration of the existing hard-coded content into the CMS data model.
// The same dataset is used for:
//   1. supabase/seed.sql (generated by scripts/cms/generate-seed-sql.mjs)
//   2. the public site's fallback content when Supabase is not configured
//   3. the in-memory mock backend used for local dashboard development
